 "about_text": "Mizuma Art Gallery was founded in Tokyo in 1994 by Executive Director Sueo Mizuma. Since then it has built a program centered on Japanese and, increasingly, Southeast and East Asian artists whose work resists passing stylistic trends. The gallery expanded internationally, opening Mizuma Gallery in Singapore's Gillman Barracks in 2012, running the Rumah Kijang Mizuma residency in Yogyakarta from 2014 to 2019, and operating Mizuma & Kips in New York with Kips Gallery from 2018 to 2023. It regularly takes part in major international fairs such as Art Basel Hong Kong, Art Dubai and Art Taipei. In 2024 the gallery marked its thirtieth anniversary as a longstanding platform for contemporary art from diverse Asian backgrounds.",
